      "statusChangeID": "6a4d57e1fbb3374625e550ee",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "As mentioned below, it's expected that worlds validate the object they're hitting using `Utilities.IsValid()` before attempting to use it, especially when the layer involved is one that VRChat uses internally rather than any of the user layers. For this reason, we're closing this report for now.\n\nWe're considering ways of automatically warning against using physics sampling methods without validating the result in the future.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
