  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Due to the fact that companions have colliders on Item/UI/Pickup this can cause Raycasts and some other physics calls to unexpectedly fail due to it returning null or be blocked by them because they are on the same layers as items (Item, UI layers).\n\nCompanions also appear on the Pickup layer during repositioning which can also cause the same issues.\n\nThe layers of the colliders can be viewed in this world (place the item inside the blue box in front of spawn and the ui canvas will display a list of colliders) https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_a5d2da68-573f-46b6-956a-235222a0d31b/info",
